# Cyberpunk Neon UI

When editing or creating game UI (UITK/uGUI menus, settlement, shop, pause):

1. Read and follow: `Notes/02_视听与界面/UI与美术风格/风格规范/CyberpunkNeon_HardPrompt.md`
2. Offline StyleKit showcase: `Notes/02_视听与界面/UI与美术风格/风格规范/index.html`
3. Match existing tokens in `Assets/UI/MainMenu.uss` (`--neon-*`)
4. Buttons: **micro-glow** like StyleKit VIEW_DEMO — not thick JACK_IN halos
5. Active = Glitch Press (`translate`), never `scale`
6. Dark only `#0a0a0f`; accents cyan / fuchsia / yellow only
